    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to XEN, the first <strong><i>kinetic fighter</i></strong>, where speed itself is the ultimate combat resource.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the future of fighting - where movement and combat are blended like never before.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement First</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical speed empowers your attacks and gives you the edge in battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dash, slash, and soar with unparalleled freedom, using 10 uniquely powerful movements systems like <i>the</i> <i>rocket-like</i> <strong>Fire Burst</strong>, <i>the</i>\u00a0<i>devastating\u00a0</i><strong>Silver Slash</strong>, <i>the</i> <i>jet-like</i> <strong>Water Pulse</strong>, <i>the</i> <i>hook-like\u00a0</i><strong>Life's Grasp</strong> and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versatile Elemental Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks can be infused with any of the 10 elements, each with it's own unique properties, strengths and weaknesses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer First</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > XEN is being developed with optimal net-code as it's main focus and priority, as we see robust networking as the foundation for quality online play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist in order to be among the first to experience the future of movement and combat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to XEN, the first <strong><i>kinetic fighter</i></strong>, where speed itself is the ultimate combat resource.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the future of fighting - where movement and combat are blended like never before.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement First</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical speed empowers your attacks and gives you the edge in battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dash, slash, and soar with unparalleled freedom, using 10 uniquely powerful movements systems like <i>the</i> <i>rocket-like</i> <strong>Fire Burst</strong>, <i>the</i>\u00a0<i>devastating\u00a0</i><strong>Silver Slash</strong>, <i>the</i> <i>jet-like</i> <strong>Water Pulse</strong>, <i>the</i> <i>hook-like\u00a0</i><strong>Life's Grasp</strong> and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versatile Elemental Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks can be infused with any of the 10 elements, each with it's own unique properties, strengths and weaknesses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer First</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > XEN is being developed with optimal net-code as it's main focus and priority, as we see robust networking as the foundation for quality online play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist in order to be among the first to experience the future of movement and combat.</p>",
    "short_description": "XEN is a high-octane &quot;Kinetic Fighter&quot; with unmatched freedom of movement, where speed itself is your main resource for combat abilities. Wield your F\u00e6therwing and call upon 10 elemental natures in order to build speed and defeat your opponents with spell and blade.",
